[tokenPartition.dl] BenchmarkStart: program=TokenPartition, maxBound=5, maxIters=120, maxSolutionsPerStep=20
[tokenPartition.dl] SeededPredicatesFromTxProperties: Map(redeemByPartition(p,q,n) :- recv_redeemByPartition(p,q,n). -> Set(Predicate(context: tx: recv_redeemByPartition(_,_,_), bindings: [owner(o), msgSender(s)], functor: s==o)), issueByPartition(p,q,n) :- recv_issueByPartition(p,q,n). -> Set(Predicate(context: tx: recv_issueByPartition(_,_,_), bindings: [owner(o), msgSender(s)], functor: s==o)))
[tokenPartition.dl] InitialTransactionRules:
redeemByPartition(p,q,n) :- recv_redeemByPartition(p,q,n),owner(o),msgSender(s),s==o.
issueByPartition(p,q,n) :- recv_issueByPartition(p,q,n),owner(o),msgSender(s),s==o.
transferByPartition(s,r,q,n) :- recv_transferByPartition(s,r,q,n).
